+/*
+ * The per-queue half of fuse_get_req()'s background gate: sleep until the
+ * queue this task would submit on has room in its share, or the connection
+ * died.  Exclusive, like the connection-wide wait it replaces - each ending
+ * request passes exactly one slot on (fuse_uring_bg_finish()).  The task may
